<title>JAPAN: Tabai Espec - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tabai Espec - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.17		vs	    8.41</p>
<p> Operating	  704 million	 vs	  314 million</p>
<p> Current	    810 million	 vs	  347 million</p>
<p> Net		  761 million	 vs	  265 million</p>
<p> EPS		   32.40 yen	  vs	   11.30 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     24 million	  vs	  24 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tabai Espec Corp manufactures meteorological environment testing equipment.</p>
</text>
